   the printed figures alone (VREF and 1 %): 19.326 to 20.694 V
   the envelope, any in-use condition   min 19.146 V, nominal 20.000 V, max 20.887 V
   M1 on the reference day              min 19.205 V, nominal 20.000 V, max 20.823 V
